      "reason": "A reviewer reports their child was threatened by another player in the game \"Adopt Me\" and police became involved. A forum participant says that even when chat is set to \"no one,\" mini-games with built-in chat cannot be disabled. Another forum participant says any user can write text on signs their avatar holds up to communicate with everyone in the same game regardless of age."
