      "reason": "The privacy policy says data will now be sold and reserves the right to resell or share data for advertising purposes to third parties. It also mentions feeding data to AI. A forum participant says images used for age verification may be processed by third-party providers but Roblox does not publicly guarantee a fixed retention period for children's images."
    },
