      "area": "content",
      "reason": "A reviewer says outfits and games are inappropriate for a 4-year-old. A Reddit participant describes user-generated \"condo games\" featuring adult content. A forum participant reports that within seconds the game \"Street Code\" showed an intense fiery car accident and prompted the player to decide whether to shoot or save an officer. Another forum participant says extreme violence, inappropriate language, and sexually explicit content is possible and quite likely in user-created games, and that content labeled 5+ may still contain inappropriate content despite maturity controls."
